.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbit-reschedule 1  "reschedule " 
.SH NAME
orbit\-reschedule \- Set a task\*(Aqs due date to a phrase, or clear it with `none`. The time is replaced too
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit reschedule\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIR\fR> <\fIPHRASE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set a task\*(Aqs due date to a phrase, or clear it with `none`. The time is replaced too
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object per result, with `"v":1`, instead of text
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable ANSI colors
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIR\fR>
A row number, id prefix or title words
.TP
<\fIPHRASE\fR>
A date phrase, or `none` to clear the due date
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  orbit reschedule 1 today
  orbit reschedule 3f2b9c "fri 9am"
  orbit reschedule 1 none
  orbit reschedule 1 tomorrow \-\-dry\-run
